5
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,150
What's the real problem?

6
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:14,160
A: bad staff.

7
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,950
B: too many warehouses.

8
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:17,280
C: no visibility.

9
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,790
