10
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:19,920
C: no visibility.

11
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,260
The stock was there.

12
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,990
The movement was recorded.

13
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:24,190
The data was real.

14
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:27,000
